 temperature meter for a room?\r\nOpen the atmosphere temperature app.\r\nKeep a good internet to measure temperature.\r\nPlace the phone on a flat surface while temperature monitoring.\r\nNavigation device will return you the weather where you live\r\nAllow the temperature checker to access your current location.\r\nLocalization allows us to get outside temperature.\r\nYou just need to open the app and wait 1-2 seconds.\r\nCheck the actual temperature in Celsius and Fahrenheit!\r\n\r\nSimple thermometer room temperature measures ambient temperature inside and outside. Use the automatic geolocation to get a very precise outside air temperature of the place where you are, wherever you are.\r\n\r\nCheck live weather radar now to see how the weather is in your current location and check around the globe with global radar weather. Never run into a storm and avoid hurricanes with live weather radar.\r\n\r\nWe also respect user privacy, so no personal information is asked and location is optional also and we do not collect at our server to provide you maximum Data safety.\r\n\r\nWe welcome your Feedback and Suggestion. So feel free to download and leave feedback for us. Thank you for using our apps!",
